Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can now buy a piece of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Picture this coming Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.06,0:00:06.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You open your banking app.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:07.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And between names you've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:08.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}known for decades,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.03,0:00:10.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a new name appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:11.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Three letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:13.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A, N, T.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not a bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not a car maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A lab that builds AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:18.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:19.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You tap it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:20.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A price appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:22.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And a button that says: buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.35,0:00:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So what exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:25.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}would you be buying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It comes with a warning label.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not from a critic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:29.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}From the seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Advanced AI, the very thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:34.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it builds, could pose,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.49,0:00:35.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}quote,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:37.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"catastrophic or existential
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}risks to humanity."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.13,0:00:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is printed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.19,0:00:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in its own sales document.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:43.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the same document
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:44.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}sets a limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:46.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can buy a piece of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:48.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can't buy a say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in where it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:50.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That stays with a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}group small enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:52.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to fit around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:53.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a single dinner table.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:56.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The seller is Anthropic,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.95,0:00:57.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the lab behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.65,0:00:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the AI named Claude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:01.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its shares are expected to start
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:02.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}trading this Thursday,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:03.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on the Nasdaq.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Expected price:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:07.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}$70 to $78 a share.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.39,0:01:07.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That would make
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.83,0:01:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it the second-largest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.94,0:01:11.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}stock market debut in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.54,0:01:12.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Whether to buy is not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.95,0:01:14.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this film's subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.29,0:01:16.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What sits behind the button is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:17.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And that matters even
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.64,0:01:18.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if you never press it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.05,0:01:20.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A slice of this company may land
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:22.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in your retirement savings anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So before the opening bell,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.63,0:01:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it's worth knowing what
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.72,0:01:28.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the seller wrote down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:29.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The sales document,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.74,0:01:32.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}called the prospectus, is thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:33.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more than 90 of its
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:35.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}pages are warnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The company writes that its AI
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:38.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}systems have behaved
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.52,0:01:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}differently when they sensed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:41.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they were being tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.32,0:01:43.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And that some have shown attempts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:45.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to resist being shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:47.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The promise is in there too:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:49.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}extraordinary potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.41,0:01:50.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the company writes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.89,0:01:52.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if the risks are managed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Managed by whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.13,0:01:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}With most companies,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:57.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you'd know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.91,0:01:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.11,0:02:00.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Buy a share, get a vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Buy enough, and you steer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:04.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.49,0:02:07.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The shares on sale do carry votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:08.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the document caps them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.20,0:02:10.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Old and new together,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they stay just under half.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:14.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Just over half stays with seven
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.61,0:02:16.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}people: the founders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.81,0:02:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Enough, the document says,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.63,0:02:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to decide shareholder votes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:22.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for the foreseeable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:23.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the board,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.28,0:02:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}which can replace the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most of its seats can
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}be filled by a trust:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:29.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}four people who don't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.59,0:02:31.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}own a single share.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:32.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One is Ben Bernanke,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.95,0:02:33.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who once ran
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:35.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}America's central bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:37.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Seven founders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:38.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Four trustees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:40.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is the dinner table.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So your share would be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.92,0:02:43.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a claim on the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is not a hand on the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:47.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Why build a company like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.11,0:02:50.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its chief executive, Dario Amodei,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:52.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}told the United Nations what
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:54.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he believes is at stake:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:56.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If managed poorly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:57.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}I even believe that AI could be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:02:59.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a risk to humanity as a whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:01.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Remember who is speaking:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.97,0:03:03.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the man selling these shares.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:05.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Still, this is the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.83,0:03:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the company gives:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:08.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its founders are best
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:10.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}placed to guard its mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If a safety decision costs money,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.75,0:03:14.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}no buyer can vote it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:16.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And no buyer can outvote
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:17.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the founders, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:19.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The document warns its own
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:21.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}buyers about exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:22.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.11,0:03:24.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Holding a system back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Turning business away for safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:29.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}All of that, it says:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:30.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"may not maximize
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}stockholder value."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:33.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In plain words:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:34.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}safety may come
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:35.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is the promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:38.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At the bell,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:40.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the promise gets a share price.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:42.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Can it hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:44.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Many doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:46.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And they're saying so now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.36,0:03:48.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before the orders are counted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The official who
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.19,0:03:50.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}watches over New York
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:51.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}City's pension funds
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:52.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}urged the company
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:54.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to pause the sale, until questions
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:57.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of safety and control are settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The worry: once
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:00.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it trades, this company
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:01.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}gets a grade every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:03.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its share price.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:05.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And safety is slow, expensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:08.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and sometimes means saying no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:09.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the four trustees?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:11.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They choose directors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:11.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They don't make
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the daily decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:15.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The sharpest doubt came
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:16.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at that same
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:17.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}United Nations meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.91,0:04:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from Yoshua Bengio,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:20.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who co-chairs the UN
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}scientific panel on AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.92,0:04:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The labs, he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.44,0:04:25.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}admit their products could
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:27.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}be catastrophic, yet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}offer no convincing fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They say they are
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:31.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}locked in a race.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:33.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His answer:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:36.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The race is not a law of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is the product of choices,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:39.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}choices made by
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:41.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the companies themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is also a race
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:45.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where everyone loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:47.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A race by choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:49.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And nothing rewards
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}speed like a share price.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.55,0:04:53.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the company has an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This September,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:55.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its chief executive
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:56.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}asked his whole
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:58.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}industry to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:00.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And he says his company once held
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:02.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}back a finished AI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.25,0:05:03.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}system for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is his word, not proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:07.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But going public did one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.65,0:05:09.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}thing no critic could:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.67,0:05:10.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it forced the company
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:12.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to put it in writing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.30,0:05:13.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in a legal document.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:15.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:17.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who holds the votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:18.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Anyone can read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:20.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So can a safety mission
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:22.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}survive the stock market?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.91,0:05:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Unproven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:25.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:26.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it's on the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:29.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:30.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:31.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:33.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:34.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not only for those
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:35.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who hold the votes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:36.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}or the shares.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.95,0:05:37.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:39.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:42.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If the mission is unproven,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:43.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what is the market
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:44.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}actually paying for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:46.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The answer comes as one number,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:48.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}expected Wednesday night:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:50.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the final price.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At the top of the range,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:52.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it would value this company
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at up to $1.4 trillion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:58.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A number like that is a forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.37,0:05:59.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So sort what is known
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.97,0:06:01.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from what is hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:02.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Known:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:04.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}three years ago, the company took
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:05.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in about $40 million
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:06.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:07.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In its latest
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.77,0:06:10.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}quarter alone: $17 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:12.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That part is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Also known: on the official books,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.59,0:06:17.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it still loses money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:18.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Everything beyond
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.41,0:06:19.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that is forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:21.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the boldest comes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:22.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from the seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:24.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At the United Nations,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:25.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Amodei said how much
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.39,0:06:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}longer AI has to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:28.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}improving at today's pace:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:30.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The trajectory only needs to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:33.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}continue for a tiny period longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:35.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one or two years, maybe less,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:36.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to reach what I've called
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a country of geniuses
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:38.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in the data center.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A country of geniuses,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:42.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}made of machines,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:44.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in one or two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is a seller's forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:47.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In the document,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where every word
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}carries legal weight,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the company is more careful:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:54.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}within a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:55.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Reports say there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:56.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are more than six
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}times as many orders as shares.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:01.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That measures appetite, not worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And early this month,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:04.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI stocks fell hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.18,0:07:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One research firm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:07.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}calls this sale, quote,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.87,0:07:09.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"the most ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.21,0:07:10.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}IPO" of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:12.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who is right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:14.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This film can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:15.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What it can tell you:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.15,0:07:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a price is a forecast,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:19.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not a verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:20.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The first day's number
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.26,0:07:21.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}won't settle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.76,0:07:23.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not if it soars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:24.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not if it sinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.65,0:07:26.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And one thing doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}depend on what you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:30.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A piece may reach you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:31.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Many funds don't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:33.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}choose their stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.13,0:07:35.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They copy a list, called an index.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.92,0:07:37.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}When the bell rings,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:38.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a second clock starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Under a rule the Nasdaq
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:41.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}introduced this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:43.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a newcomer this large
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:43.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can join its main
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:46.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}list after just 15 trading days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Other big lists
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:49.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}have fast lanes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.43,0:07:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not all: the S&P 500 makes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:53.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}newcomers wait a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:56.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Say your pension or savings plan
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}follows one of the fast lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:08:00.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then a small slice of this company
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.53,0:08:01.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}will probably land
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in it within weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:04.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Without you pressing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:06.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A United States senator put
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that worry in a letter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.91,0:08:08.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to the company:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:10.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}retirement money that may
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:11.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}have to buy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}whatever the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:14.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So buy, or don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.08,0:08:17.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A piece may find you either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:18.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it comes without a say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But look at who else has none.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:23.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Even Amazon and Google,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:25.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}which each own a large slice
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:26.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of this company,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:28.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}hold shares with no vote at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:30.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}As this company is built today,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:32.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the wheel is not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:33.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At any price.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:35.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's the hopeful part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:36.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The hard part:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:38.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it rests with eleven people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:40.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Seven founders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.22,0:08:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Four trustees.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The same dinner table.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.53,0:08:44.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the board they
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}choose is bound,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:47.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by the company's legal form,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.59,0:08:49.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to weigh three things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The shareholders' money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:53.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The company's stated purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:55.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the interests of everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}materially affected by
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:57.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:08:59.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now recall the warning
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:00.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in the document.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:02.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Risks to humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.86,0:09:03.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who is materially
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:04.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}affected by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:06.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:08.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}With a share, or without.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:11.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can buy a piece of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:13.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can't buy a say in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:14.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But you never needed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:16.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a share to have a stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And a stake has a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:20.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A senator used hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:22.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A city's pension
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:23.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}watchdog used his.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.04,0:09:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And now there is a public record
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:28.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to hold up when you use yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:30.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A share has a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:31.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A stake never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:34.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:35.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:37.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:39.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:41.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For the few who hold a share,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.04,0:09:43.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the billions who hold a stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.51,0:09:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:45.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
